                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "29a5f371-3024-342b-bb0f-914e887ce0b4",
                        "entry_id": "01098a81-b6f6-3d01-90ac-cf33be5df21c",
                        "glosses": [
                            "книжн. территория, природные богатства которой (животные и растения) находятся под особой охраной государства; заповедник"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "c1f668b8-7067-4d52-8f9a-380967774aee",
                                "sense_id": "29a5f371-3024-342b-bb0f-914e887ce0b4",
                                "text": "По этим выводам в стране была создана целая сеть резерватов, иначе говоря, заповедников (сейчас их больше трёхсот), где земли принадлежат животным и только животным."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "f80ee4da-9c71-40af-9926-5538e38eb7ae",
                                "sense_id": "29a5f371-3024-342b-bb0f-914e887ce0b4",
                                "text": "Одни изменения грубы, очевидны, они сметают целые природные комплексы, и животные исчезают просто из-за того, что им некуда деваться. Так случилось, например, с уникальной фауной Африки: крупные животные сохранились только в национальных парках и резерватах."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "75e933b6-cc3a-4918-bb0f-be526aeb8dc0",
                        "source_entry_id": "01098a81-b6f6-3d01-90ac-cf33be5df21c",
                        "source_sense_id": "29a5f371-3024-342b-bb0f-914e887ce0b4",
                        "target_lang_word": "nature reserve",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "nature reserve",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "13a82837-0d3f-32a8-a553-1f15a6ea498c",
                                        "entry_id": "5aa5e247-16ad-371a-9a26-12e511b1a14d",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "An area of land managed to conserve wildlife or plant habitat or other natural features."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "976eb434-92e0-4a04-8a8a-5763985482ea",
                                                "sense_id": "13a82837-0d3f-32a8-a553-1f15a6ea498c",
                                                "text": "The whole area is a network of nature reserves among estuaries and marshes, and a paradise for a moocher like me."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "0a0d942e-add4-4da5-b6eb-70d7e9606e7d",
                        "source_entry_id": "01098a81-b6f6-3d01-90ac-cf33be5df21c",
                        "source_sense_id": "29a5f371-3024-342b-bb0f-914e887ce0b4",
                        "target_lang_word": "conserve",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "conserve",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "32b53ee3-c791-32d6-9647-b30657f4d3a7",
                                        "entry_id": "59a88a5b-d675-39aa-bf41-c47dbe81cdea",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Wilderness where human development is prohibited."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "9625b810-bac8-317d-a415-55bddc7cd5ab",
                                        "entry_id": "59a88a5b-d675-39aa-bf41-c47dbe81cdea",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A jam or thick syrup made from fruit."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "31801ad8-cafc-4a3b-8da9-72194b40a93f",
                                                "sense_id": "9625b810-bac8-317d-a415-55bddc7cd5ab",
                                                "text": "I shall […] study broths, plasters, and conserves, till from a fine lady I become a notable woman."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "d28550d2-1c88-3b2a-938d-d2da7952ef1d",
                                        "entry_id": "59a88a5b-d675-39aa-bf41-c47dbe81cdea",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A medicinal confection made of freshly gathered vegetable substances mixed with finely powdered refined sugar."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "obsolete"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "52755204-5a80-3b28-a0f8-5ae7d6d088a8",
                                        "entry_id": "59a88a5b-d675-39aa-bf41-c47dbe81cdea",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A conservatory."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "obsolete"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "789114c4-7fd6-4c5b-926e-c8f74495f8c9",
                                                "sense_id": "52755204-5a80-3b28-a0f8-5ae7d6d088a8",
                                                "text": "water[…]alwayes placed in the Conserve"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "conserve",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "c62c3faa-3e1d-3b15-9fbc-8fb37256aef2",
                                        "entry_id": "d816e331-ce8f-3004-a8da-79189938226b",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To save for later use, sometimes by the use of a preservative."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "transitive"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "01cd5e82-18f3-4c62-a7f9-85650b3c3ce7",
                                                "sense_id": "c62c3faa-3e1d-3b15-9fbc-8fb37256aef2",
                                                "text": "to conserve fruits with sugar"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "501e50c8-516e-4a15-9bfb-1b65078c1128",
                                                "sense_id": "c62c3faa-3e1d-3b15-9fbc-8fb37256aef2",
                                                "text": "the amity which […] they meant to conserve and maintain with the emperor"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "8fc41aec-eff9-4c0d-b226-9b63432bbdac",
                                                "sense_id": "c62c3faa-3e1d-3b15-9fbc-8fb37256aef2",
                                                "text": "Also the Russian lines over which these locomotives run pass through long stretches of waterless country, where the only alternative to hauling additional water-tank wagons is to conserve the water supply by condensing."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "2357f7f9-3ab3-3ce5-979b-a831e0eb2d41",
                                        "entry_id": "d816e331-ce8f-3004-a8da-79189938226b",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To protect an environment, heritage, etc."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "transitive"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "3917b8b0-cc7a-4df9-8e9a-765d38dc187b",
                                                "sense_id": "2357f7f9-3ab3-3ce5-979b-a831e0eb2d41",
                                                "text": "Two entrants shared this award for their work on two quite different stations, but with the same purpose of bringing a redundant station building back into use for the benefit of the community, with the added result of conserving an historic building. Saltash Town Council bought Saltash station building after it had become very decrepit and 'an eyesore' - such that it was nearly pulled down to make way for housing."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "368fff9c-2a2d-3ca1-8a80-5ff236fe1d8f",
                                        "entry_id": "d816e331-ce8f-3004-a8da-79189938226b",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To remain unchanged during a process"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "intransitive"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    }
